<title>UK: KFW unit sets 500 million mark zero-coupon bond.</title>
<headline>KFW unit sets 500 million mark zero-coupon bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KFW INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  KREDITANSTALT FUER WEIDERAUFBAU</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    29.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  81.67     PAY DATE    29.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    79.92     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY     *AAA	 LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	 *AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.25 PCT  SELL CONC   1.75 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	*GUARANTOR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
